<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-17151] Inconsistent keys after deletion during rebalance</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-17151</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Scenario:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Stop a node&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Load data while the node is still offline&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Start the node&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;While the node is online and rebalancing delete objects&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Wait for the node to complete rebalancing and verified the partitions via partition_reconciliation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Reproduced is attached.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
